v class=\"fr-view\">\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_03/week3_test_question17.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div><p><br/></p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">カタカナのほうが むずかしいです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q18</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please select all options that answer this question correctly: これは　やまださんのですか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">はい、そうです。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">いいえ、やまださんのじゃありません</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q19</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please select all options that answer this question correctly：その　パソコンは　どこのですか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Sonyのです。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">にほんのです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q20</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please select all options that answer this question correctly：まいあさ　なにを　たべますか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">なにも たべません。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">パンと たまごを たべます。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q21</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please select all options that answer this question correctly：にちようび　どこへ　いきましたか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">しぶやへ いきました。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">どこも いきませんでした。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-it